Scope: the MIT license above covers the software in this repository
(simulators, experiment scripts, patches, figure generators, scenario
files). The manuscript (paper/), slides, and their figures are
copyright of the authors and are included for reference; third-party
inputs retain their own terms.

Third-party note: the scripts under sim/tier2/dtnsim_patch/ are patch
installers that modify the dtnsim simulator
(https://github.com/lggaray/dtnsim, pinned at commit
a9cf3fc655308a95884260a53878fbecb5d09708), which carries its own
license; dtnsim itself is not redistributed here. The scripts under
sim/ion/ drive NASA's ION-DTN 4.1.4 (also not redistributed). The
committed iridium.tle snapshot derives from CelesTrak GP data (see
sim/tier2/TLE_PROVENANCE.md).
